{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710230/extras/48dbce882daf0e49fc67f28458d0f984.apng?t=1766774144\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710230/extras/48dbce882daf0e49fc67f28458d0f984.poster.avif?t=1766774144\" class=\"bb_img\" width=735 height=140 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>YUNODREAM</i></strong>\u00a0is a game where the serene, peaceful appearance of the village sharply contrasts with the inner darkness of its protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll explore two parallel states of the same world \u2014 one bright and cozy, the other distorted and filled with unease. By moving between them, you\u2019ll uncover fragments of memories, gradually piecing together a personal story of loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a quiet, meditative experience with a strong focus on atmosphere, visual contrast, and sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710230/extras/2ff112a06376dcc55dd52a4ebca2a724.webp?t=1766774144\" width=140 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Experience the contrast between the village\u2019s bright, carefree atmosphere and the inner weight of its lone inhabitant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Explore two parallel states of the same place \u2014 the familiar and the distorted</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Discover fragments of joyful memories to gradually piece together what was forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710230/extras/2b51b4da25366298a64db890f761b05e.webp?t=1766774144\" width=150 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 A story not about escaping nightmares, but about learning to live with what cannot be changed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Hand-crafted pixel art, where each world reflects the protagonist\u2019s inner state</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 An atmospheric soundtrack that conveys the shift from innocent nostalgia to distorted perception of reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Approximately two hours of quiet, personal experience with a emotional impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710230/extras/05ea1945bd5a7c06c3c27a1a3fbf8d47.apng?t=1766774144\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710230/extras/05ea1945bd5a7c06c3c27a1a3fbf8d47.poster.avif?t=1766774144\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=98 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3710230?t=1766774144","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710230/bbedea9e88073b2b7ae177da9f1ced89eb920c65/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766774144","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710230/96783a9c27521650d696bc2f1c6f799c7c2cd9b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766774144","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710230/96783a9c27521650d696bc2f1c6f799c7c2cd9b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766774144","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game explores themes of depression and contains scenes of violence, as well as references to suicide and death. Some players may find this content disturbing."},"detailed_descri